</tbody>
</table>
<p>The homeowner example leaves out private mortgage insurance, HOA dues, MUD taxes and maintenance, which many Houston buyers will also pay. Set aside money every month for repairs; heat and humidity are hard on HVAC systems and roofs.</p>
